# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The default plaque model since 2026-10-17, by the maintainer's choice; toxoplasma_plaque_v3 is the recommended alternative for Gel Doc wells and toxoplasma_plaque_v4 stays selectable."
